 "level_notes": {
  "1": "The grammar at bsonspec.org (version 1.1) is the specification; MongoDB's driver specifications (Extended JSON, Decimal128, ObjectId, UUID) refine it.",
  "0": "libbson (in mongo-c-driver) and the PyMongo bson package are vendor implementations; the BSON corpus in mongodb/specifications is the shared conformance suite for all drivers."
 },
